   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Layout from a Sentence (the eighth video tutorial)\n\n1. Write the idea in the Prompt Enhancer on the left (layout mode), saying where each thing goes:\n   left / right, upper / lower, at the top. Give the exact words of any text in quotes, or it may invent them.\n2. Press DRAFT LAYOUT under the Layout Editor's canvas: only the enhancer runs (no image) and its boxes appear:\n   characters orange, objects blue, text purple. Check them: over 6 enhancer seeds the title, the fisherman\n   and the signature were always in place, the sun got its own box in 3 (this is seed 2).\n3. Move, resize, draw or delete boxes. Your boxes are never replaced by a normal run (IMPORT offers a new draft).\n4. GENERATE (the same as Run). HaDeS MOSS v1.0 Turbo, 8 steps, CFG 1, no turbo LoRA: it is baked in.\n   Over 8 image seeds: title, sun and signature in their boxes 8 / 8; the fisherman on the left 8 / 8,\n   his net and legs past his narrow box (a box is a strong hint, not a cage). The sun moved down to the\n   horizon followed its box 8 / 8.\n5. MOSS Text Check reads each text box: exact / close / missing / outside its box. Both texts exact 8 / 8,\n   about 1 s. One wrong letter is close. failed_mask marks the boxes that did not pass."
   ],
   "properties": {}
  }
